    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Bubberman, Jeske M., Joep A. F. Van Rooij, René R. W. J. Van der Hulst, und Stefania M. H. Tuinder. „Sensory Recovery and the Role of Innervated Flaps in Autologous Breast Reconstruction—a Narrative Review“. Gland Surgery 12, Nr. 8 (11. August 2023): 1094. https://doi.org/10.21037/gs-23-40.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>G, Pereira, Ribeiro D, Saraiva L, und Freitas H. „Supercharging DIEP Flaps Using Contralateral Superficial Inferior Epigastric Vein Grafts“. Clinics in Surgery 8, Nr. 1 (16. Oktober 2023): 1–4. https://doi.org/10.25107/cis-v8-id3667.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>He, Jiqiang, Huairui Cui, Liming Qing, Panfeng Wu, Gunel Guliyeva, Fang Yu, Maolin Tang, und Juyu Tang. „Strategies for selecting perforator vessels for transverse and oblique DIEP flap in male pediatric patients: Anatomical study and clinical applications“. Frontiers in Pediatrics 10 (23. September 2022): 978481. https://doi.org/10.3389/fped.2022.978481.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Lee, Kyeong-Tae, und Goo-Hyun Mun. „Benefits of Superdrainage Using SIEV in DIEP Flap Breast Reconstruction: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis“. Microsurgery 37, Nr. 1 (Januar 2017): 75–83. https://doi.org/10.1002/micr.22420.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
