    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Arpaci, E., R. E. Unlu, S. Altun, und N. M. Ertas. „Super Kutler Flap: An Alternative Technique for Reconstruction of Fingertip Defects“. Journal of Hand Surgery (European Volume) 42, Nr. 6 (1. Juli 2017): 626–32. https://doi.org/10.1177/1753193416686884.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Chakraborty, Sourabh Shankar, Prakash Chandra Kala, Ranjit Kumar Sahu, Pawan Kumar Dixit, Deepti Katrolia, und Suresh Kotu. „Fingertip Amputation Reconstruction with VY Advancement Flap: Literature Review and Comparative Analysis of Atasoy and Kutler Flaps“. World Journal of Plastic Surgery 10, Nr. 3 (September 2021): 8–17. https://doi.org/10.29252/wjps.10.3.8.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
